# Convention (2026-08-10): issues/<n>-<slug>/ work folders hold the .md doc,
# debugging scripts, and results.  Track ONLY documents + scripts.
# Data files, logs and figures stay local (force-add a figure with `git add -f`
# when it is explicitly requested for the issue write-up).

# --- data / heavy artifacts ---
*.root
*.h5
*.npz
*.npy
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.bz2
*.gz
*.db

# --- logs ---
*.log

# --- figures (force-add on request) ---
*.png
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg

# --- scratch data dirs inside issue folders ---
issues/*/data/
